    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38095" root="لوث" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَاتٌ لَائِثٌ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَاثٌ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيِّثٌ</span></b> , <i>A tangled
plant;</i> (K;) <i>a tangled and luxuriant plant:</i>
and in like manner, herbage: <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَاثٌ</span> is originally
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَوِثٌ</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَائِثٌ</span>: (TA:) so also a tree. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اللَّائِثُ</span>
(and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اللَّيْثٌ</span>, TA,) <i>The lion:</i> (K:) from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَوْثٌ</span>
“ strength. ” (TA.)

